      "message": "Enhance SEO, accessibility and content schemas\n\nExpand and harden site SEO and accessibility: rewrite src/components/SEO.astro to support multiple schema types (article, localBusiness, collection, medical, transport), breadcrumbs, ItemList, richer ImageObject and Organization nodes, canonical/full-URL handling and noindex logic. Improve Layout and pages to pass new SEO props (schema, breadcrumbs, items, wordCount, section, noindex) and set lang=es-AR. Add stricter HTML validations in scripts/validate-dist.mjs (lang, single H1/title/meta description/canonical/robots, image alt, JSON-LD graph and references). Small accessibility/performance tweaks (decoding, fetchpriority, rel noopener), content.config added 'modificada', README and public headers/robots updated, and removed an unused OG image.",
